Package: PooGwaM
Type: Package
Title: Validated Multi-Response Regression for Phenotype-Defined Pools
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(person("Bhargob", "Kakoty", role = "aut"),
    person("Mohammed-Amin", "Madoui", email = "amine.madoui@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Christophe", "Ambroise", role = "aut"))
Description: Fits deterministic regularized regression to allele frequencies
    and multiple phenotypes measured in pools. Provides explicit identifiers,
    quality control, phenotype pooling, joint sparse estimation and bounded
    null-model calibration with documented assumptions. Exploratory scores
    are separated from calibrated probabilities. External association
    programs are managed by a separate benchmark rather than reimplemented.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
